      <activity id="84546b88-0060-5dd2-9273-8a8d76bed027" activityNameId="b2ed69bf-f0bc-5dc1-bbe5-6d1d31a6038a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, low voltage, PV, at 3kWp slanted-roof, single-Si, panel, mounted, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, low voltage, PV, at 3kWp slanted-roof, single-Si, panel, mounted, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: eb9dc64f-0ff3-33b8-8dba-199deeeddcb3
Included are the electricity production in 0, the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Ozone- and NO2-emission factors are based on published measurements made in various countries.  Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swiss data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: total electricity in Switzerland: 60 TWh
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_eb9dc64f-0ff3-33b8-8dba-199deeeddcb3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
